{"id":"mlfsc0x6l5mkjgar2eu6wgh4j","title":"币安将于11月20日移除GAS/TRY、HBAR/BNB等5个现货交易对","originalTitle":null,"summary":"币安宣布将于11月20日11:00（东八区时间）下架GAS/TRY、HBAR/BNB、HIVE/TRY、KSM/TRY和ZAMA/TRY现货交易对并停止交易。币安表示会定期审核所有上线现货交易对，可能因流动性、交易量不佳等多种因素下架部分交易对，以保护用户并维护高质量交易市场。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1ed07-e83c-7359-bb4d-f454d0e4e3e3"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:01:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T06:53:42.985Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T06:53:42.985Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["产品上线","交易所","Binance"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"4bfc1da9-af3e-4073-bae3-6f7b3c977c1e","title":"币安下架5个现货交易对并设置用户操作截止时间"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"4bfc1da9-af3e-4073-bae3-6f7b3c977c1e","title":"币安下架5个现货交易对并设置用户操作截止时间"}],"topics":[{"slug":"binance","name":"Binance / 币安"},{"slug":"exchanges","name":"交易所"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f9GOSE5bPkZc","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}